  id: tutorial_welcome
  displayName: Welcome to your colony
  order: 10
  body: 'You are the mind of an ant colony. The queen sits in the royal chamber just under the grass, with a few workers. Food becomes eggs, eggs become ants, and ants dig, gather and build.


    This tutorial shows you the basics. Skip a step or end it whenever you like; you can start it again from the help ({Help}).'
